openproject              | 2f0eb3d1-3e2a-4ce7-8060-5e47ad877e47 | prod | /openproject                     | openproject.env                   | dump
immich                   | 2f0eb3d1-3e2a-4ce7-8060-5e47ad877e47 | prod | /immich                          | immich.env                        | dump
stream                   | 2f0eb3d1-3e2a-4ce7-8060-5e47ad877e47 | prod | /stream                          | stream.env                        | dump

